{"4819030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deal Flipper", "steam_appid": 4819030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD TO WISHLIST</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819030/extras/856802c7b65da7db9bab3b3d93849147.poster.avif?t=1787515369\" width=800 height=66 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819030/extras/856802c7b65da7db9bab3b3d93849147.webm?t=1787515369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819030/extras/856802c7b65da7db9bab3b3d93849147.mp4?t=1787515369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Buy low, sell high. Master the art of the deal.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal Flipper is a first-person flipping sim where the entire market lives online. Scour a marketplace full of underpriced treasure, haggle with sellers in real-time chat, and resell your finds for profit. But here's the catch: every trader thinks, reacts, and bargains differently. Read them right, and the deal is yours. Lowball the wrong seller, and they'll walk away, taking the item with them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819030/extras/8e9cef25a2b5839f2e13038d5dc3ce88.poster.avif?t=1787515369\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819030/extras/8e9cef25a2b5839f2e13038d5dc3ce88.webm?t=1787515369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819030/extras/8e9cef25a2b5839f2e13038d5dc3ce88.mp4?t=1787515369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>🔍 Hunt the Marketplace<br>Scroll through an endless feed of secondhand listings. A vintage gold watch for $10? A &quot;Ming Dynasty vase (probably)&quot;? The deals are out there, buried between the junk. Spot what's underpriced, judge what's worth your money, and open a chat the moment you see an opportunity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819030/extras/97c7e9326c0937c56608418caa3fc31a.poster.avif?t=1787515369\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819030/extras/97c7e9326c0937c56608418caa3fc31a.webm?t=1787515369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819030/extras/97c7e9326c0937c56608418caa3fc31a.mp4?t=1787515369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>💬 Master the Negotiation<br>This is where Deal Flipper sets itself apart. Every deal is won or lost in chat and every trader has a profile. Their Knowledge, Patience, Greed, and Stubbornness shape how they bargain. Check a seller's stats before you make your move: a greedy one holds out for more, a patient one won't blink at your lowball, and a knowledgeable trader knows exactly what their item's worth. Push the wrong seller and they'll snap back or refuse to sell at all. Read each profile, adapt your offers, and outdeal them all.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819030/extras/5d69aee256354a3596d72465bee386ca.poster.avif?t=1787515369\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819030/extras/5d69aee256354a3596d72465bee386ca.webm?t=1787515369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819030/extras/5d69aee256354a3596d72465bee386ca.mp4?t=1787515369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>📦 Stock, List &amp; Flip<br>Once a deal closes, your package arrives. Place it on your shelves, then relist it on the marketplace, at your price. That $8 watch becomes an &quot;$89 vintage heirloom.&quot; Flipping isn't just about buying low; it's about selling smart.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819030/extras/f2820773444961cced4fd0bb3dbe0388.poster.avif?t=1787515369\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819030/extras/f2820773444961cced4fd0bb3dbe0388.webm?t=1787515369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819030/extras/f2820773444961cced4fd0bb3dbe0388.mp4?t=1787515369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>📈 Build Your Empire<br>Start with pocket change and a single desk. Track every item's full profit history: daily, weekly, and monthly. Study how the market moves, and turn small flips into big margins. What begins as a pocket change hustle becomes a full-blown trading operation. Every item is its own little economy, and mastering them all is how empires are built.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819030/extras/a43a4275e2d0eb7d56adbcce90580c6b.poster.avif?t=1787515369\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819030/extras/a43a4275e2d0eb7d56adbcce90580c6b.webm?t=1787515369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819030/extras/a43a4275e2d0eb7d56adbcce90580c6b.mp4?t=1787515369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Features:<br><br>💻A marketplace that never sleeps — no storefront, no foot traffic, just you and an endless feed of deals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💬Real-time chat negotiation — haggle your way to the perfect price, message by message</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠Trader profiles that matter — every seller's Knowledge, Patience, Greed, and Stubbornness shapes the deal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📦The full flip loop — hunt, haggle, stock, relist, and sell at a profit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📊Deep profit tracking — follow each item's daily, weekly, and monthly history and learn how prices move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏪From one desk to an empire — scale a pocket-change hustle into a full-blown trading machine </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Buy low, sell high. Master the art of the deal.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal Flipper is a first-person flipping sim where the entire market lives online. Scour a marketplace full of underpriced treasure, haggle with sellers in real-time chat, and resell your finds for profit. But here's the catch: every trader thinks, reacts, and bargains differently. Read them right, and the deal is yours. Lowball the wrong seller, and they'll walk away, taking the item with them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819030/extras/8e9cef25a2b5839f2e13038d5dc3ce88.poster.avif?t=1787515369\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819030/extras/8e9cef25a2b5839f2e13038d5dc3ce88.webm?t=1787515369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4819030/extras/8e9cef25a2b5839f2e13038d5dc3ce88.mp4?t=1787515369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>🔍 Hunt the Marketplace<b